WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Father-in-law works hard

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:01,880
I'll go check it out right away

3
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,000
If His Majesty asks

4
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,000
I also asked my father-in-law to help me with a few kind words.

5
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,240
Mr. Fang, don’t worry

6
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,240
Your Majesty is not really angry about this.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:13,130
Just go and re-identify. Thank you, father-in-law. Don’t worry, I’ll go there right away.

8
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,890
Such a big emperor

9
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,490
Why do you have to be serious with me, a loser?

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,220
Young Master, that brothel girl, you?

11
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:22,780
What should I do? I have it in my mind

12
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,060
Good morning to you too

13
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,760
If the young master really takes this brothel girl home,

14
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,760
How can I explain it to the master?

15
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:32,720
But Mr. Fang is here and it’s me

16
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,480
I'm really sorry for you guys

17
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:35,680
Busy the past few days

18
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,160
I've been looking for someone to replace me for a few days.

19
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,850
Dare I ask the adults how to call them?

20
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:42,570
Mr. Fang is going to kill me. My surname is Zhao.

21
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,890
It's just a little tooth wing plaque

22
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,290
How can I be considered an adult?

23
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,960
There was nothing good about the first meeting.

24
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,440
I brought two bottles of Tianxian Zui

25
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,600
Give everyone a try

26
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,160
You can't do it, Mr. Fang

27
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,440
This thing is too valuable

28
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:58,640
Where can we collect it?
